OL,3,GNEWSAWhy we took our clothes off in a
OL,4,Ashop window
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Peru and Tina Boden were fed up
OL,7,Fof women feeling like they should be
OL,8,Fashamed of their bodies, so they
OL,9,Fdecided to strip off their clothes for
OL,10,Fa campaign to challenge ageism and
OL,11,Fpromote self-acceptance.
OL,13,FThe women, both in their 50s, became
OL,14,Flive mannequins for the day in a
OL,15,Flingerie shop window in Nantwich,
OL,16,FCheshire, on Friday to spark
OL,17,Fconversations and encourage bra
OL,18,Ffittings.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
