OL,3,GNEWSAWhy we took our clothes off in a
OL,4,Ashop window
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The reaction from other women makes it
OL,7,Fall worth what we are doing, we want
OL,8,Fwomen to walk past and see bodies they
OL,9,Fcan relate to," said Peru.
OL,11,FBoden added: "It was a perfect day, as
OL,12,Fit made women feel seen."
